{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303670/extras/af42a8c4402f36826e02205f968841fa.poster.avif?t=1757681613\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303670/extras/af42a8c4402f36826e02205f968841fa.webm?t=1757681613\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3303670/extras/af42a8c4402f36826e02205f968841fa.mp4?t=1757681613\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewind back to 2004 and find out why so many students are going missing in Noirmont High. A choices-matter game inspired by the greatest mystery TV shows from the eighties and nineties.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Initial traits and fears to choose from - </strong>are you more athletic, resourceful or perceptive? And what's your greatest fear?\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery  - </strong>why did so many people disappear from Noirmont High with no trace?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comic book panels - </strong>walk, run, sneak around in a 3D world, and experience every interaction in hand-drawn comic book panels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Nostalgic soundtrack and ambient\u00a0</strong>\u00a0-<strong>\u00a0</strong>a good old 80s vibe everywhere you look (even though we're in the 2000s)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not a dating sim... or? </strong>- nahhh</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3303670?t=1757681613","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3303670?t=1757681613","c